### Obtener catálogo de rutas
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/GetCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 1,
  "divisionId": 1,
  "sourceLocationClassId": 0
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/GetCatalog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 1,
  "divisionId": 1,
  "sourceLocationClassId": 0
}
